// Test that an included header that is invalid based on the input-charset
// option triggers the fallback to UTF-8 for that header.

// Test for various ICU converters.

// REQUIRES: icu

// RUN: %clang_cc1 -verify -finput-charset IBM-943C -I %S/Inputs/ %S/Inputs/ibm-943c/include-utf-8-header.cc
// RUN: %clang_cc1 -verify -finput-charset IBM-eucJP -I %S/Inputs/ %S/Inputs/ibm-eucjp/include-utf-8-header.cc

The IBM-943C and IBM-eucJP files are converted from:
```
#include "utf-8/neither-sjis-nor-ujis.h"
// expected-warning@* {{interpreting as UTF-8}}
constexpr auto North = 北;
constexpr auto South = 南;
constexpr auto East = 東;
constexpr auto West = 西;
```
